  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "DSH Instagram Business & Automation Duties Plugin (`@luoyi-dsh/instagram-plugin`)",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n**[English](README.md) | [繁體中文](README.zh-Hant.md) | [Agent & Operational Guide](AGENTS.md)**\n\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH Instagram Business & Automation Duties Plugin (`@luoyi-dsh/instagram-plugin`)",
      "text": "> Relies on `@luoyi-dsh/instagram-mcp` for FastMCP connectivity and centralized account credentials (`username` & `masterUsername`).  \n> This plugin provides two core operational capabilities:  \n> 1. **Safe Read-Only Browsing & Exploration**: Browse creator posts, Reels short videos, explore timeline feeds, and search users/tags without liking, posting, or triggering account risk.  \n> 2. **AI-Driven Social Duties**: Background fuzzy topic patrol with smart recommendation comments, grounded @mention (RM) multimodal reasoning on Posts & Reels, and AI Direct Message (DM) responses powered by DSH Platform Subscriptions (`dsh-plugin-subscriptions`) or custom LLM APIs."
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH Instagram Business & Automation Duties Plugin (`@luoyi-dsh/instagram-plugin`)",
      "text": "> [!CAUTION]\n> ### ⚠️ CRITICAL WARNING & DISCLAIMER\n> 1. **Violation of Instagram Terms of Service & Community Guidelines**:\n>    This plugin interacts with Instagram via unofficial reverse-engineered APIs, which **expressly violates Instagram / Meta's Terms of Use and Community Guidelines**.\n> 2. **DO NOT USE YOUR PERSONAL / PRIMARY ACCOUNT**:\n>    **Never use your personal, primary, or business-critical Instagram account!** Running automated scripts carries an extreme risk of **Action Blocks, Challenge Checkpoints, temporary lockouts, and PERMANENT ACCOUNT SUSPENSION / BANNING**.\n> 3. **Disclaimer**:\n>    This project is provided strictly for educational and technical research purposes. Use entirely at your own risk!"
    },
    {
      "section": "DSH Instagram Business & Automation Duties Plugin (`@luoyi-dsh/instagram-plugin`)",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "section": "🌟 Key Features",
      "text": "1. **Zero-Config Account Inheritance**:\n   - Automatically inherits both the Bot account (`username`) and Master account (`masterUsername`) from `@luoyi-dsh/instagram-mcp`.\n2. **External Subscription Quota & Multi-Tier LLM Engine**:\n   - Reads authorized quotas from `dsh-plugin-subscriptions` (Google Antigravity, OpenAI Codex, xAI Grok, GitHub Copilot) and supports custom OpenAI / DeepSeek APIs with automatic HTTP 402 failover.\n3. **Grounded Post & Reel Mention Replies (RM)**:\n   - Reads the full Post or Reel context (caption, title, accessibility visual description, Reel audio metadata, video subtitles, multimodal image inspection, and parent comments) before replying to `@mentions`—never hallucinating or using canned responses.\n4. **Strict Anti-AIGC Filtering**:\n   - Automatically filters out AI-generated videos, animations, artwork, and content-farm articles during search and patrol.\n5. **Safe Read-Only Browsing & Multi-Tier Anti-Risk Safeguards**:\n   - Enforces per-run caps, hourly/daily quotas, humanized jitter, and automatic 30-minute circuit breaker cooldowns."
    },
    {
      "section": "🌟 Key Features",
      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "section": "🚀 Installation",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "Via DSH Plugin CLI",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add @luoyi-dsh/instagram-plugin"
    },
    {
      "section": "Or via npm",
      "text": "npm install @luoyi-dsh/instagram-plugin\n```\n\n---"
    },
    {
      "section": "📖 Operational Guide & Tool Reference",
      "text": "For complete DSH tool definitions, read-only browsing & automation REST APIs, LLM configuration, and usage examples, please refer to **[AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md)**.\n\n---"
    },
